{"parentUuid": "06797b59-efa9-589e-a1a0-f6b0b391a601", "isSidechain": false, "type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_synth_02897a3b0613ee439631", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_synth_b41e35519efff05fc7cb", "name": "Edit", "input": {"file_path": "{{WTF}}/business/Lab/Ember/docs/BIBLE.md", "old_string": "## 5. 补天盟\n- `[定]` 上界老修士结成的同盟，行事低调，各界都有人\n", "new_string": "## 5. 补天盟\n- `[定]` 上界老修士结成的同盟，行事低调，各界都有人\n- `[定]` 动机：天衡在慢慢松动，几百年后各界边界撑不住，会互相吞并，死的人更多\n- `[定]` 办法：抽干一整个界的灵脉去补天衡，首选沉壤（修为低，按他们的算法「代价最小」）\n- `[定]` 不是坏人，是算账的人：牺牲一界救两界，他们真心觉得对\n"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "e96936dc-32c8-5368-a577-243f969c054a", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T03:03:40.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "c36903ee-de66-5580-b83a-f7bbb37f9469", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD"}
